# Rust build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Backtrace/profiling output
*.profraw

# Coverage report (regenerated by `cargo llvm-cov`; uploaded to Codecov in CI).
/lcov.info

# insta pending snapshots — review with `cargo insta review`, never commit.
# Accepted `.snap` baselines ARE committed (they're the test oracle).
*.snap.new

# Pixel-oracle review bundle (regenerated each run). The committed oracle is
# e2e/baselines/*.png; the review/ dir is just the expected|actual|diff viewer.
/e2e/review/

# Local-only Claude Code instructions (personal, not shared with the team).
CLAUDE.local.md

# Claude Code: keep personal/local bits out, but share skills (and project
# settings) checked into the repo.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
